<title>HONG KONG: Morgan sets warrants on First Pacific.</title>
<headline>Morgan sets warrants on First Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it intended to issue 280 million American-style warrants on shares of First Pacific Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$10.035	 PREMIUM	   13.73 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.2703	 GEARING	   4.14X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.NOV.97	 LISTING DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  HK$11.20</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
